url: "https://saroshhussain.com/blog/what-356-ai-system-prompts-write-down"
keywords:
  - AI agents
  - system prompts
  - AI safety
  - guardrails
  - prompt injection
  - human in the loop
abstract: >-
  Per-prompt coverage of 23 written safeguards in 356 publicly collected AI
  system prompts (83 production agent prompts, 273 GPT Store prompts), with
  pinned-source identifiers, content hashes, and a re-runnable scoring script.
  Measures what prompt text states, not runtime behaviour. Prompt text is not
  redistributed.
